<title>SPAIN: Spain 1-yr T-bill yield unchanged at 5.579 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain 1-yr T-bill yield unchanged at 5.579 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at Wednesday's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> ISSUE Yield    Pvs     Price    Pvs     Bid    Allocated</p>
<p> 1-year 5.579   5.579   94.66   94.66   434.258  380.911</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
